Now let me understand the flaky test better. It fails because Git Status is present but Recently Changed Files is not:
  ╭─ Turn 16 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
  ▶ $ cd /home/runner/work/yoyo-evolve/yoyo-evolve && sed -n '90,120p' src/context.rs ✓ (3ms)

The --diff-filter=M flag only shows files that were modified (not added or deleted). If a CI run's recent commits only add new files, this returns empty → None → the section is absent → but Git Status IS present → assertion fires. The fix should either use `--diff-filter=AMCR` (any change) or make the test less strict.

